  "remarks": "TAi.026 Title: Mullah. Designation: a) Minister of Education under the Taliban regime (1996-2001). b) Taliban representative in UN-led talks under the Taliban regime (1996-2001). Passport no:  a) Afghanistan diplomatic passport D0009716, issued on 25 Sep. 2021, issued in Kabul, Afghanistan (Name in Latin script: Amir Khan Mutaqi, name in original script: اميرخا ن متقي ; expires 25 Sep. 2026) b) Afghanistan diplomatic passport D0009803, issued on 13 Dec. 2021 (expires on 13 Dec. 2026). Member of the Taliban Supreme Council as of June 2007. Believed to be in Afghanistan/Pakistan border area. Belongs to Sulaimankhel tribe. Height 170 cm.; Listing: Listed on 25 January 2001 (amended 3 Sep 2002, 21 Sep 2007, 29 Nov. 2011, 10 Mar. 2026)",
